# r1116 phase 1, boot 1 (prep_srv.sh OUT tx A): SQ-TX-01 to -18 (first boot part of -18). SQ-TXQ-01 is judged from
# this run's lint output, verdict files and qrun table. Site x 900 to 1000, z 890 to 910, superflat (grass -61).
pace 2

## SQ-TX-00 | setup: forceload site, noon, clear weather
> forceload add 896 880 1007 927
> time set noon
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> weather clear
sleep 3

## SQ-TX-01 | help, unknown verb, unloaded pos, missing arg
> cdevtest help
> cdevtest bogus
> cdevtest state 0 -60 4000
> cdevtest count 1 2 3
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=help verbs=\S*state\S*tickwarp\S*states
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=bogus error="unknown verb
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=bogus done=0
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=state error="unloaded 0,-60,4000
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=state done=0
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=count error="missing to x"
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=count done=0
reject Exception|\tat 

