## SQ-TX-09 | data verbs against /zq
> cdevtest recipes minecraft:bread
> zq recipes minecraft:bread
> cdevtest food minecraft:bread
> zq food minecraft:bread
> cdevtest tag item minecraft:logs
> zq itemtag minecraft:logs
> cdevtest states
> zq states all
sleep 5
> cdevtest rdetail create:crushing/
> cdevtest bytype minecraft:smelting
> cdevtest uses minecraft:wheat
> cdevtest makes minecraft:bread
> cdevtest tagsof minecraft:oak_log
> cdevtest attrs minecraft:diamond_sword
> cdevtest reg item ^minecraft:wheat
> cdevtest potion minecraft:awkward minecraft:sugar,minecraft:spider_eye
> cdevtest item minecraft:bread
sleep 3
expect verb=rdetail .*part=results
expect verb=bytype .*n=[1-9]\d{2,}
expect output="minecraft:potion minecraft:swiftness"
reject verb=(recipes|food|tag|states|rdetail|bytype|uses|makes|tagsof|attrs|reg|potion|item) done=0
count verb=(recipes|food|tag|states|rdetail|bytype|uses|makes|tagsof|attrs|reg|potion|item) done=1 == 13
look counts and values equal the /zq lines (recipe count, nutrition and modifier, tag size, state count); attrs n= 2+ on mainhand; spider eye gives awkward or nothing

